[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13203.67, "timestamp": "03:40:03", "text": "好的，我们来看看最后一个。现在，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13215.83, "timestamp": "03:40:15", "text": "呃，列表项？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13218.95, "timestamp": "03:40:18", "text": "我认为它会变成一个跨度。是的，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13222.469, "timestamp": "03:40:22", "text": "变成一个跨度。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13231.269, "timestamp": "03:40:31", "text": "等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13233.75, "timestamp": "03:40:33", "text": "我有个主意。想法可以改变你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13236.15, "timestamp": "03:40:36", "text": "生活。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13249.91, "timestamp": "03:40:49", "text": "然后我删除了 span 元素。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13253.11, "timestamp": "03:40:53", "text": "所以，结果它变成了一个链接。"}]